  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "all",
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all",
    "executionTimeout": 120
  },
  "description": "CE v1.4.2 API/MCP DELETE records IssueActivity verb=deleted field=issue but does not emit workspace webhook. Every 5 minutes read native API v1 deletion activities for cached live PERSO items and enqueue confirmed deletes in same native inbox. A 404 alone is never treated as deletion; archiving/permissions cannot produce deletion notifications."
}
